 "withdrawn_reason": "the check amended a 90-minute reservation from 18:00 to 19:00, only a 60-minute gap; by the half-open occupancy rule in S1.1.6 a hypothetical re-booking of the freed 18:00 slot would occupy [18:00,19:30) which genuinely overlaps the new [19:00,20:30) occupancy, so t_1 correctly stays unavailable at 18:00 regardless of whether release-and-reserve is atomic. Verified with a 120-minute gap (18:00 to 20:00, >= the 90-minute duration): the old slot (18:00) correctly shows free and the new occupancy correctly blocks only the slots that actually overlap it. The service's atomic release-and-reserve is correct; my check's chosen gap was the bug.",
